 dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"包含测点\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fb34bd4df3c583e0",`source`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`target`:"shipkg:sensor:173be47ae689",`properties`:{`name`:"包含测点",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fb34bd4df3c583e0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:9adb71d01088504c",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh. Gas Mass Flow",`quote`:"full_name=Exh. Gas Mass Flow; symbol=Mexh; unit=kg/s; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"包含测点\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fe049a757fc3bcaa",`source`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`target`:"shipkg:sensor:0d9978f872ad",`properties`:{`name`:"包含测点",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fe049a757fc3bcaa",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:80918215733870aa",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh.Gas Power",`quote`:"full_name=Exh.Gas Power; symbol=Qexh2; unit=kW; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=other",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"包含测点\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fe7d4eb6c9fdf2b2",`source`:"shipkg:dataset:1ceeb4cad6d8",`target`:"shipkg:sensor:5c1900646ca4",`properties`:{`name`:"包含测点",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fe7d4eb6c9fdf2b2",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:300d98a15fc95cf3",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Cooling water flow",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Cooling water flow; symbol=Qw_air; unit=m3/h; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"包含测点\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:HAS_CHANNEL {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_19 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:006a785db589c4f8",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c1ffab11185c",`target`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:006a785db589c4f8",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5192357e40ea3dd4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"f the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:2dfbdbf1c8a3c98e",`source`:"shipkg:condition:fc22b54510b9",`target`:"shipkg:condition:4277de3a84c9",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:2dfbdbf1c8a3c98e",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:37ba783e68d5a5a2",`source`:"shipkg:fault:40958d8dddba",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:37ba783e68d5a5a2",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:80d60dbbffd49fa6",`source`:"shipkg:condition:9e280aeb615b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:80d60dbbffd49fa6",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:8891c036cde74d94",`source`:"shipkg:cause:cf3cb78b47cf",`target`:"shipkg:fault:aba0717d72a0",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:8891c036cde74d94",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me_2017",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:7407bf8cf7722325",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"am ensured the safety of the vessel, passengers and crew. • Volvo Penta’s investigation into the engine failure concluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete in",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:896cf06f4f90c08a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`target`:"shipkg:condition:ed8375f7583f",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:896cf06f4f90c08a",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:8fb3da4a6ad8dacd",`source`:"shipkg:condition:9e0b58e70948",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:8fb3da4a6ad8dacd",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:01e497b491874531",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"Caterpillar was approved on the basis that genuine parts were used. The CTP parts were designed for a standard service interval. Use of the CTP parts beyond their design life led the connecting rod bearings to fail, initiating a chain of mechanical failures that culminated in the engine failure and subsequent fire. The extended service intervals were inappropriate for these substitute components, accelerating the risk of failure. Anchoring",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:aba7bc4650a67d26",`source`:"shipkg:consequence:fc1835efb5ca",`target`:"shipkg:condition:2d0261049d78",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:aba7bc4650a67d26",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bd29efb1b18cf94",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societie",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b1ecac9cff5b11cd",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2ac2de665aa1",`target`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b1ecac9cff5b11cd",`case_id`:"sd2013_02_control_air",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:5bedf556e2401880",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"diate investigation identified that the main lubricating oil discharge pipe assembly in No1 compressor had detached, and that the bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Shortly afterwards, the centre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:b72140166c9b6e90",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8027eb707475",`target`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:b72140166c9b6e90",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:157ede421b19ee3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"neer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:f91e30b569a1ffe4",`source`:"shipkg:cause:0c02674d6024",`target`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`properties`:{`name`:"很可能促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:f91e30b569a1ffe4",`case_id`:"kommandor_susan_dg1_2025",`certainty`:"probable",`certainty_zh`:"很可能",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f282b514e870587",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"oot cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4). Figure 3: Comparison between genuine OEM (left) and CTP bottom end bearings (right) Image courtesy of Pon Power",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}},{`id`:"edge:fd3a7af3d7b6d40d",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7da9174934f9",`target`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`properties`:{`name`:"促成",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:true,`id`:"edge:fd3a7af3d7b6d40d",`case_id`:"sd2013_03_turning_gear",`certainty`:"reported",`certainty_zh`:"报告明确记载",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"促成\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": true}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:CONTRIBUTED_TO {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_20 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:008aa258d569a844",`source`:"shipkg:fault:0a5da1da4336",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:008aa258d569a844",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d72a1ed6647ccd",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Injector_Nozzle/Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Injection-valve nozzle clogging; nominal_load=load program (~40-85%); severity_or_program=two-hole plugged nozzle / load program; header_rows=3; data_rows=6791; columns=73; anomaly_state=all-anomaly (no baseline segment); notes=Anomalous operation only (no baseline segment). Compressor Filter Loss (dPf) and Turbine Back Pressure (dPex) not recorded in this run (columns present but empty).",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0106d19583f0d5ff",`source`:"shipkg:component:28a67e535633",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0106d19583f0d5ff",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a815947a42cdaece",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist along with a Royal Navy helicopte",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:02686b58cf82a529",`source`:"shipkg:component:c3d265fa990c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:02686b58cf82a529",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e9210d8dbe9bf48",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had intr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:02ca32e45e6ed203",`source`:"shipkg:fault:db9b4536b139",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:02ca32e45e6ed203",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e8101941c0ddc6d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ng emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:02fc2b5ed60651a8",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:674bee46af7f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:02fc2b5ed60651a8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e28dc346f51844d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:03266002fdfa26fc",`source`:"shipkg:condition:f61e4eef7cce",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:03266002fdfa26fc",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1caa6757e63a8feb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"62",`locator`:"PDF page 62",`quote`:"ed lifetime of 20 years due to the operating conditions being harsher than expected. The initial degradation of the capacitor was likely to have been caused by one or both of the following: • being subjected to voltages in excess of their design rating • being exposed to frequent voltage transients due to increased number of switching cycles Failure initiation due to minor manufacturing anomalies s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0343d13eaea989f5",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:e94fb52827fa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0343d13eaea989f5",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f8c03d1dccfd00e",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Turbine Back Pressure",`quote`:"full_name=Turbine Back Pressure; symbol=dPex; unit=Pa; dtype=number; in_reference=FALSE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure; note=Present in all scenario files for schema uniformity; recorded values in 10 of 15 scenario files. Empty (not recorded) in: AC_Fouling_85_Load.csv, Clogged_Injector_Nozzle1_40_60_85_Load.csv, Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv, CW_Pump_Cavitation_60_Load.csv, CW_Pump_Cavitation_85_Load.csv.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0572be31fff2b324",`source`:"shipkg:cause:29f8307f5eed",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0572be31fff2b324",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ed4a18d326cb49be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased the likelihood of crack initiation and fatigue failure. Other factors that contributed to the engine failure included: standards of maintenance management; lack of appreciation of the importance of following the engine manufacturer’s instructions for the removal and refitting of the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:05e14e29f505ee0b",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:5f5652f7036e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:05e14e29f505ee0b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:09d27f6992891305",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:LO Cooling water flow",`quote`:"full_name=LO Cooling water flow; symbol=Qw_lo; unit=m3/h; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:05f1ae2e0881bbcf",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d26785dacafa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:05f1ae2e0881bbcf",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0688c2183202ec54",`source`:"shipkg:component:a85d6cb18c5c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0688c2183202ec54",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0733b8d1b06e876a",`source`:"shipkg:action:32b0fb5f9f2b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0733b8d1b06e876a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:08612a8344f50120",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8969204ea965",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:08612a8344f50120",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:08c55eccde19b0f8",`source`:"shipkg:action:fa72ffe2b82b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:08c55eccde19b0f8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:05847d350f09dacc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"eak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:097962b6708c834a",`source`:"shipkg:check:050d6770cfa0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:097962b6708c834a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1e3e12480476352c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"icient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (Figure 3). 3. All vessels are required to comply with SOLAS regulations regarding the maximum allowable temperature of an exposed surface (Chapter II/2): • All surfaces with temperatures above 220°C which may be impinged as a re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0a57256c18eb2079",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4277de3a84c9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0a57256c18eb2079",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:412268fc761e9960",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"ions. 2.4 HOT SPOT MONITORING Stena’s practice of measuring the temperature of running engines using an infrared spot thermometer had not identified the significant hazard posed by exposed surfaces of over 220°C that still existed post-accident after the insulation and shielding were replaced. The use of infrared spot thermometers in engine spaces limited their effectiveness as they could only prov",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0aadae7556f90b65",`source`:"shipkg:condition:fc22b54510b9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0aadae7556f90b65",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:446e44bf86c01e9d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"the external fuel systems on the remaining engines was missed and the risk of fuel leakage remained high. [2.3. 1] 4. Much of the insulation and shielding on all of Stena Europe’s engines was in a poor state of repair or missing completely. The ship’s crew and shore management had become accustomed to this condition over time, possibly due to the age of the vessel, leading to machi",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0b3d9d80992101cb",`source`:"shipkg:action:157f8a0199e8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0b3d9d80992101cb",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ee08dc0eebc21a7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row8",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 shaftline reductor / CAT C7 case B; Fault or condition=Babbitt wear (Pb); Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -4.0; oil alert at Month -1.2; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=2.8; Warning (h)=420.0; Recommended CBM action=Oil-confirmed mixed follow-up; 250 h vibration / 250 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0c920d1c9017b191",`source`:"shipkg:condition:d96dbed6a05c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0c920d1c9017b191",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0cdca27d9f471e2a",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:9d91c2845b73",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0cdca27d9f471e2a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a52dfb1b2f1d73b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"arrative A fully loaded ro-ro passenger ferry was en route to its next port when the engineers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent en",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0efccc104bc9881e",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0efccc104bc9881e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0f1ff5fa49494e9b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:3349e319bedc",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0f1ff5fa49494e9b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0f9f311d5a7796fd",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:563809ad0932",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0f9f311d5a7796fd",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ff3253f5416e42be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"es. The MAIB investigation identified that the catastrophic damage to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0fdc086fe009ded3",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:d2a57b31e287",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0fdc086fe009ded3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:10d8f96aa55a9e20",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:10d8f96aa55a9e20",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2937d3b0bfe9d29f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:11e1dca3c36d2860",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:d9ffd75bfab4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:11e1dca3c36d2860",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:bb4c3f647e81f1d2",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Engine Speed",`quote`:"full_name=Engine Speed; symbol=N; unit=rpm; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=operating / load",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:12aab1eaaa6034e9",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4ae93bca9f29",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:12aab1eaaa6034e9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d1bc8efb3c65396",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"’s main engine fuel systems were historically reported in the vessel’s DOCMAP system. However, this had stopped over time and the crew instead repaired the leaks and recorded them locally in the engine room logbook. The relatively high turnover and heavy workload of engine room crew had resulted in defect reporting being considered a low priority, which had led to the requirements in SMS document SMM-0255 not bein",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:151625604920f911",`source`:"shipkg:fault:a7ebb889d098",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:151625604920f911",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2c91ce63ed55748b",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row2",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C MPEB 1V; Fault or condition=Unconfirmed bearing-related spectral anomaly; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -2.5; oil alert at Month -0.8; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=1.7; Warning (h)=255.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:17e9a04f09929cc9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b2aa91be158b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:17e9a04f09929cc9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3bea0430b472030b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"current imbalance transformer were tested during manufacture, subsequent tests of the system were by secondary current injection, bypassing the windings. As the IAS did not specifically register which rank of the HF had developed an imbalance current, it was not possible to confirm if the current imbalance transformers on rank 1 1.3 had ever worked in service. It is concerning th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:17f819589d86b303",`source`:"shipkg:component:be4ab56339d8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:17f819589d86b303",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0b7a42308cc8b6cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"D OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:18c17913d9b3fc9a",`source`:"shipkg:condition:52a5771f68ca",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:18c17913d9b3fc9a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:59a2040fb754c1d5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"28",`locator`:"PDF page 28",`quote`:"21 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 8 The Lessons 1. Unlagged sections of exhaust piping will radiate heat to the protective casing, causing it to attain temperatures sufficient to ignite an oil or fuel spray. 2. These temperatures are not visible to the eye unless the surface is glowing. However, a thermal image will immediately identify unlagged sections (F",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:18f06d6e030180ee",`source`:"shipkg:component:a53bfe23945e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:18f06d6e030180ee",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1b2cad2aebdc21b9",`source`:"shipkg:component:1157de5d43da",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1b2cad2aebdc21b9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e2523ed63e0b4019",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"at Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset o",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1bc77c83895d7e3d",`source`:"shipkg:fault:1a73f1a1e185",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1bc77c83895d7e3d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1f80efa15bdc4c0e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"y barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1c2e7cb6937ec6aa",`source`:"shipkg:action:cc44cd1c6032",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1c2e7cb6937ec6aa",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:26b16a38271f6b21",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row6",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C azimuth unit EB 2; Fault or condition=Gear mesh anomaly; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -1.0; maintenance event; Reference class=LTI_maintenance; LTI / warning (mo)=1.0; Warning (h)=150.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1d8b3c210ddd1d3d",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:1755b4f618f2",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1d8b3c210ddd1d3d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:19d0b2283f62b511",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"examination conducted by the vessel’s engine maker, Volvo Penta UK, concluded that the most probable trigger for the failure was debris in the engine’s oil channels following rebuild. The MAIB investigation established the following: • The engine had been completely rebuilt and failed after 5½ hours of operation. • The vessel’s soft patches 1 had not been removed, necessitating the engine to be lowered piecem",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1da9d7a549c5330c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:96cc1c0ff36e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1da9d7a549c5330c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a67a93bfec361edf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embedded in the main bearing shells, engine misalignment, high levels of vibration, and contaminated lubricating oil might all have",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1f6fa15739f31ff6",`source`:"shipkg:condition:553e318feb99",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1f6fa15739f31ff6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:951a6820ce2d0fc6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"alarm, mustering the remaining crew. The seaman rigged the portable electric water pump on the main deck but, with the vessel now running on emergency power only, he was unable to start the pump. The master contacted the coastguard by VHF radio and advised that the vessel was flooding. The coastguard transmitted a “Mayday Relay”, and RNLI lifeboats from two stations were tasked to assist",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:20fc4c75223be3e1",`source`:"shipkg:fault:86ef7d39fd57",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:20fc4c75223be3e1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5192357e40ea3dd4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"f the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:210b2cceab2a555f",`source`:"shipkg:check:7bc4821b359e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:210b2cceab2a555f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f402f62ae7b113ec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"a water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to all vessels in the area. As the vessel began to",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2144f26201ce087f",`source`:"shipkg:condition:f4f364d25a5d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2144f26201ce087f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fb6cf34a58c7fe85",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"f water ingress to the cargo hold, all six crew abandoned to one of the lifeboats. The vessel continued to flood (Figure 1), with water entering the accommodation areas through the open engine room doorway. The vessel’s owner contracted salvors, who were able to stop the flooding and, once stable, the vessel was towed into port.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2194a46a070ed50e",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a5960af425f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2194a46a070ed50e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6374a9e189a094d1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"e was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be reported. Living with the problem is not a solution. 3. It is important that the status of the main engine machinery conforms to t",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:21978167aff599f0",`source`:"shipkg:action:b1b278b9bbdd",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:21978167aff599f0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c7e7236b07b0d8d2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"obal GmbH & Co. KG has: ● Updated the SISHIp eSiPods software and corrected the operators’ manual. ● Updated the PCS to include a revised WLS sequence activation that allows the crew to intervene and prevent the SISHIp eSiPODs parking at 90° to the vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilg",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:21e13b17380ef2e4",`source`:"shipkg:component:864e3371e086",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:21e13b17380ef2e4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:22a4c1d018d4162f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:825e44b518ef",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:22a4c1d018d4162f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f636d583be533fd",`source_file`:"TSRF_main.zip",`source_url`:"https://github.com/TS-RF/TSRF",`page`:"",`locator`:"data/Linner-wear.csv",`quote`:"Linner-wear.csv",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:24b011608ed90126",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:7e4664b82d74",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:24b011608ed90126",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:168ca21b8f311885",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:TCH LO Cooling water flow",`quote`:"full_name=TCH LO Cooling water flow; symbol=Qw_turb; unit=m3/h; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:24c2261dd8592474",`source`:"shipkg:component:6432d2482f06",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:24c2261dd8592474",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:157ede421b19ee3a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"neer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn or Not to Turn?",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2515eeb0bbfde464",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a27034a0842",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2515eeb0bbfde464",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:26a82edea7c6179d",`source`:"shipkg:condition:5d3ac9abb37a",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:26a82edea7c6179d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:383cc33975e2e37e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the wheelhouse, then broadcast a “Mayday” message on VHF radio, which was received and relayed by the coastguard to",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:27ba3d29b09b4076",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:0d9978f872ad",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:27ba3d29b09b4076",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:80918215733870aa",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh.Gas Power",`quote`:"full_name=Exh.Gas Power; symbol=Qexh2; unit=kW; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=other",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:28523785c507e158",`source`:"shipkg:action:8f48968a672d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:28523785c507e158",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:43a7cad5a93294eb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"articularly if they are tired or distracted. This type of risk is typically reduced on bridges and in engine control rooms by the fitting of protective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the st",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:28911275f6448f9f",`source`:"shipkg:action:ddf392fcaa6c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:28911275f6448f9f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:53344f366942bb5f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"ented a maintenance programme in which at least PSV1, PSV3 and NRV6 are disabled and their function checked once every 5 years. • Added a full flow check-valve, with an opening pressure of 10-12 bar, in the return oil circuit by-passing PSV3, the Oil Cooler and NRV6. Also, an additional alarm signal was to be fitted in the control system to give an alarm at 9-10 bar. For all ships in it",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:299ba3b096eaf95f",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:5c1900646ca4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:299ba3b096eaf95f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:300d98a15fc95cf3",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Cooling water flow",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Cooling water flow; symbol=Qw_air; unit=m3/h; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2a48247f5c7f3ed7",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7d61f4e32250",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2a48247f5c7f3ed7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4ed3569c8bb32f4f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"CASE 3 17MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warnin",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2a97e78dee7e5507",`source`:"shipkg:fault:d047fdea9ee9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2a97e78dee7e5507",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dcba2393344bd01c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"e engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:2c8577ffddcd1522",`source`:"shipkg:fault:3a609fe447a8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:2c8577ffddcd1522",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9de953977942cbdf",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Turbine_Degradation/Turbine_Degradation_40_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Turbine_Degradation/Turbine_Degradation_40_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scen