ing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3235f6a8cc30b355",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:3e7f89ac810b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3235f6a8cc30b355",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fe1c60aff6da4452",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"52 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 22 Supper Would Have Been on Time if the Vessel Had Not Sunk Narrative A 24m steel hulled fishing trawler, with a crew of six, was fishing in calm seas when its engine began to make unusual noises. No-one was in the wheelhouse; the skipper, who was on watch, had gone to the mess room to prepare supper and the majority of the crew wer",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:323764b15e9ba708",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:00688defba1b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:323764b15e9ba708",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:338c172fac81555c",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:7675b8a8bef8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:338c172fac81555c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3356e199bb43f210",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Cooling Water Temp. Engine In",`quote`:"full_name=Cooling Water Temp. Engine In; symbol=T6; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:354ecab6d22d6b9f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:020786dc9fd0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:354ecab6d22d6b9f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:37a7a55227b22868",`source`:"shipkg:fault:cba0553c7db4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:37a7a55227b22868",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ee08dc0eebc21a7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row8",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 shaftline reductor / CAT C7 case B; Fault or condition=Babbitt wear (Pb); Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -4.0; oil alert at Month -1.2; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=2.8; Warning (h)=420.0; Recommended CBM action=Oil-confirmed mixed follow-up; 250 h vibration / 250 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:37d660db98c282f5",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:0d7957f0c12c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:37d660db98c282f5",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7293e870a8d5467f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"CASE 12 39MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 Narrative It was a clear, bright morning as the crew of a small passenger catamaran arrived on board to carry out their routine pre-sailing checks before their first trip of the day. While the master carried out his navigational aids checks, the mate went to the engine rooms and checked the fuel and main engines",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3b10597ef4a3d44a",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:710361995928",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3b10597ef4a3d44a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c3429f0fc22579e1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3d33d86f11ab6067",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3d33d86f11ab6067",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:31361433815a45d9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"stigated but could not find any fault with the engine. He reset the alarm and continued with his duties. Several hours later, the OMD alarm activated again. The chief engineer was in the engine room and saw smoke vent from the main engine crankcase explosion relief doors. A lubricating oil low pressure alarm, and a lubricating oil low pressure trip alarm soon followed. The engine th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3d5eb448f410179f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5737f3610967",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3d5eb448f410179f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1caa6757e63a8feb",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"62",`locator`:"PDF page 62",`quote`:"ed lifetime of 20 years due to the operating conditions being harsher than expected. The initial degradation of the capacitor was likely to have been caused by one or both of the following: • being subjected to voltages in excess of their design rating • being exposed to frequent voltage transients due to increased number of switching cycles Failure initiation due to minor manufacturing anomalies s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3e450e4db3f00f95",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:49d861a78ba3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3e450e4db3f00f95",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:01f3913bd9c46899",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"f Forth, Scotland on 25 January 2025 SUMMARY At 1305 on 25 January 2025, the site investigation vessel Kommandor Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propu",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3e50df8e5d9fe6d4",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:427673f0da2d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3e50df8e5d9fe6d4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:cb384ca96e3f30da",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Air Temp. In",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Air Temp. In; symbol=T14; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3efe599dc1e4c368",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:385291025daa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3efe599dc1e4c368",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:861eb8fbe47cd585",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. Th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3f16f243ec65a7c3",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:23fe6c4f1acc",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3f16f243ec65a7c3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8c30394060f9cd2e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"d, most likely, occurred gradually over a long period of time. 2.3.3 Pipework joints and shielding Whereas the main components of Pride of Canterbury’s CPP system were supplied after testing by the manufacturer, the interconnecting pipework was supplied and fitted by the shipyard when the vessel was constructed. Although the manufacturer’s drawings specified a particular type",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:419af988ad250242",`source`:"shipkg:check:fa162d9e9a3f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:419af988ad250242",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c74257f47f29e86a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"72",`locator`:"PDF page 72",`quote`:"ble to determine why the technician made such a basic error. However, the engine manufacturer’s investigation identified that the serial numbers on the connecting rods and caps were not routinely checked to ensure that they matched following assembly. To mitigate the risk of similar errors, Volvo Penta introduced an improved method of identifying and matching the connecting rods into its production process. 2.4 OTHER WIGHT CLASS",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:42872f3d3e1a78fd",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c1ffab11185c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:42872f3d3e1a78fd",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5192357e40ea3dd4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"f the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the flange bolts. The actuator had previously been repaired. However, the c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:42ac7f6610c55a10",`source`:"shipkg:component:d16e663b1271",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:42ac7f6610c55a10",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:470e8782d7a79377",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"t in the starboard CPP system, onto the hot exhaust uptakes of the starboard main engines. The flanged joint ruptured because the CPP system became over- pressurised as a result of the back pressure valve (PSV3) becoming jammed in the closed position. The reason for the temporary increase in the starboard main engine load to 100% and corresponding increase in turbocharger rpm has not been det",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:42cb6bd8b9be7157",`source`:"shipkg:fault:8d2d73a67f71",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:42cb6bd8b9be7157",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:921221ff746c010e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious approach to the use of the engine until a deeper technical investigation could be conducted. • The fire",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:42db8fe2166d1a03",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:09fb65289e45",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:42db8fe2166d1a03",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:401af2b35a1b0e89",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Loss in Charge Air IC",`quote`:"full_name=Loss in Charge Air IC; symbol=Qrej_air; unit=kW; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=performance / derived",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:43c620ab4a95acf1",`source`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:43c620ab4a95acf1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:43e0087fb0999020",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b7f3d0b1bf24",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:43e0087fb0999020",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c6b798ec4934dc08",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"iling checks, he wiped the engine sump dipstick on a rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:46018d75bce8d007",`source`:"shipkg:fault:91dfc7218234",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:46018d75bce8d007",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:79a139cd88957e11",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Air-cooler fouling; nominal_load=75%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=6354; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4607e458d4d9c2b9",`source`:"shipkg:fault:e97eee073fc6",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4607e458d4d9c2b9",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:755b4102fd859a55",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"y’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automat",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:47329d6c0df5d387",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:47a6f6945bb5",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:47329d6c0df5d387",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a827f088fee8abd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"er being dimmed overnight, the master attempted to adjust the brightness. Distracted by a conversation with the chief officer, he pressed the wrong button (Figure 1) and inadvertently switched the vessel’s starboard controllable pitch propeller (CPP) from its normal control mode to its back-up mode. The error was not spotted by the master or his bridge team as they continued toward",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4749bb00efe25cec",`source`:"shipkg:condition:133adfa97595",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4749bb00efe25cec",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6d6d03a1efd0d418",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"ated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation for abandoning the vessel, but instead took personal",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:48e528c678ba3789",`source`:"shipkg:component:5fbf5f22d00c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:48e528c678ba3789",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2180f44fb45d636d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ssel. Are you prepared for a flooding emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actuator had been defective, giving an impression that the valve was fully closed when it was not. Although there was a visual indicator located on the side of the actuator, this was not checked to confirm that the valve was closed prior to removal of the f",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4d0d6acc4fb9e522",`source`:"shipkg:fault:439f73a406a0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4d0d6acc4fb9e522",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4d6380bc67a3cc19",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c174651a93a",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4d6380bc67a3cc19",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9f5f82cce37a3aa9",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row10",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 engine case A EB / CAT C7 shaftline case A; Fault or condition=Fuel dilution; Detection/event reference=Oil-dominant alert at Month -0.3; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4e16a864a7f7baec",`source`:"shipkg:condition:db2e89c50479",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4e16a864a7f7baec",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3bea0430b472030b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"current imbalance transformer were tested during manufacture, subsequent tests of the system were by secondary current injection, bypassing the windings. As the IAS did not specifically register which rank of the HF had developed an imbalance current, it was not possible to confirm if the current imbalance transformers on rank 1 1.3 had ever worked in service. It is concerning th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4f6d750ca8f3a804",`source`:"shipkg:fault:72c71c94ca13",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4f6d750ca8f3a804",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e235f3eb9480640d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"al. Never delay unnecessarily when abandoning a sinking ship. 4. The rate of water ingress and the speed at which the vessel sank suggests the failure of a main engine sea water cooling pipe. Analysis of maintenance records showed that this pipework had not been inspected or renewed for many years. Sea inlet pipework should be thoroughly checked during planned maintenance periods. skipper, who had remained in the whe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:50d52c96b57a5049",`source`:"shipkg:component:828d4178b93f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:50d52c96b57a5049",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1abb50030379f9ee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"rag, which he casually left on a tank top above the engine exhaust manifold. Vibration caused the oil-soaked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:51099d1b6ba3e8d3",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:024350fd8dee",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:51099d1b6ba3e8d3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:af6ff177f229c6a2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e suppression spray heads were activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour spr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:52f0feefae409fb2",`source`:"shipkg:action:6e0e5173ee8f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:52f0feefae409fb2",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1ed28429bcfc3816",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"tion of this button bypassed the feedback control system, giving direct control of pitch to the pitch control lever. However, the master was not familiar with its use, and therefore lost the opportunity to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set duri",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:53aef46f30bb2a58",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:aef67aa11eac",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:53aef46f30bb2a58",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:45a436ad6dfdc32b",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. In",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. In; symbol=T16; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:53b6c743d3911d7c",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:2c5d17b46b26",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:53b6c743d3911d7c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9f20c51ce9a64e85",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Cooling Water Temp. Engine Out II",`quote`:"full_name=Cooling Water Temp. Engine Out II; symbol=T8; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:54d65d1021bed806",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:d2a57b31e287",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:54d65d1021bed806",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:55f3c5ca7a74488e",`source`:"shipkg:component:726d763bfec1",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:55f3c5ca7a74488e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e1952d272da22996",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"ere activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour spr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:565a48b97ba817d6",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:5007e1617236",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:565a48b97ba817d6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c31d55ce6b8d61c0",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Fresh Cooling Water Press.",`quote`:"full_name=Fresh Cooling Water Press.; symbol=Pl_water1; unit=V; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure; note=raw voltage signal associated with HT cooling-water pump pressure; not converted to engineering pressure units",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:56f43c28c7bf1df7",`source`:"shipkg:observation:36b9efa16da9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:56f43c28c7bf1df7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:44f19b4f5b32f488",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row4",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C coupling EB 1; Fault or condition=Coupling resonance; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -2.0; maintenance event; Reference class=LTI_maintenance; LTI / warning (mo)=2.0; Warning (h)=300.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:576464172d26ebb2",`source`:"shipkg:check:de8a5b9844ad",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:576464172d26ebb2",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d2bfff6df47b53cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warning lamps cannot be rectified immediately, they must be repo",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5814f3e7756dd54e",`source`:"shipkg:check:5a2af85dcbf4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5814f3e7756dd54e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:38d40fe90e8b2dbf",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"69",`locator`:"PDF page 69",`quote`:"when there are no alternative or back-up systems, must fail safe. They should also be tested at regular intervals to verify that all the sub-components in the system are functional. [2.4.5] 7 . Awareness of arc-flash hazards needs to be significantly increased throughout the marine industry, so that designers, builders, owners, operators and engineers understand the hazard, risks and the potential risk redu",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_21 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:5a7c38086f9bfe98",`source`:"shipkg:component:46d84bd3b794",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5a7c38086f9bfe98",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f4e14e047a77ffb2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"n by the engineer. When the main engine start button was pressed to turn the engine on compressed air, a loud bang was heard; the turning gear interlock, the last remaining safety barrier, had failed to work. The resulting damage to the shaft and gearing (Figure 1) and to the turning gear casing (Figure 2) disabled the ship for a month and cost a six-figure sum to repair. To Turn",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5d817dfc42beb4e4",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7b886d9d51c3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5d817dfc42beb4e4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:38b5d9eb759b1681",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fu",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5e4f8c011d8148e5",`source`:"shipkg:cause:8a2abf94d478",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5e4f8c011d8148e5",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d8028bdc4d93a0c8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"Opportunities to identify and diagnose engine problems early, and therefore avoid catastrophic failures, were missed because the condition of the engine lubricating oil and coolant was not closely monitored. [2.6.2] [2.6.3] 9. Some aspects of the maintenance work carried out by RKM did not meet the standards set by Volvo Penta and those expected by Wightlink. Assembly errors had been made during overhauls, basic levels of workshop c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:5e7ce321c8536e12",`source`:"shipkg:component:8052e7754d5f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:5e7ce321c8536e12",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e32631e4946436ab",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"rod cap number six comes off. Pon Power’s report concluded that: With the facts gathered the most likely root cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4)",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:608f4ad8323aa9b3",`source`:"shipkg:fault:7d0ec41f122b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:608f4ad8323aa9b3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:26b16a38271f6b21",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row6",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3516C azimuth unit EB 2; Fault or condition=Gear mesh anomaly; Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -1.0; maintenance event; Reference class=LTI_maintenance; LTI / warning (mo)=1.0; Warning (h)=150.0; Recommended CBM action=Vibration-led CBM; 125 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:60d61441d169eb9c",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7d61f4e32250",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:60d61441d169eb9c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4ed3569c8bb32f4f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"18",`locator`:"PDF page 18",`quote`:"CASE 3 17MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 The Lessons 1. The turning gear interlock had not been included within the planned maintenance system on board and there was no record of it having been tested. 2. Control console illumination panels are vital to the safe operation of machinery and should therefore be tested regularly. If problems with visual indication or warnin",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:630cad9d85888d11",`source`:"shipkg:component:3552bc595328",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:630cad9d85888d11",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ff3253f5416e42be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"es. The MAIB investigation identified that the catastrophic damage to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:640bc13bbed27300",`source`:"shipkg:action:16d3373950f9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:640bc13bbed27300",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9225f4c20470527c",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ns taken by other organisations Gardline Shipping Limited has: • Rebuilt DG1 with genuine spares, including a new engine block; • Completed major overhauls of DG2, DG3 and DG4 using genuine Caterpillar parts; • Changed the onboard anchoring procedure, highlighting that clutches must remain disengaged when the winches are not in use to ensure they remain ready for use in the event of power failure. RECOMMENDATIONS In view of the actio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:655b00c83ae1791a",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:482eb47f8513",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:655b00c83ae1791a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c9d838c8d843eeee",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Shaft Power",`quote`:"full_name=Shaft Power; symbol=Ws; unit=kW; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=other",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:661e4adf58901a1b",`source`:"shipkg:action:4a27034a0842",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:661e4adf58901a1b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a14d5a0a3ae37d97",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"11",`locator`:"PDF page 11",`quote`:"h priority. ACTION TAKEN Windcat Workboats BV Ltd has: • Instructed crews on board vessels fitted with Volvo Penta D16 engines to stop the affected engine when a high oil temperature alarm activates, and not to restart the engine until the reason for the alarm has been determined. • Identified lessons to be learned from the accident and emergency response that will be highlighted in future crew training. • Programmed additio",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:67053191ac4359d3",`source`:"shipkg:condition:0a605c97371c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:67053191ac4359d3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d2abeeb05ea44b5",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"parked at 90° to the vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:68bbaaead8b15625",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:ae5a2be19a3b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:68bbaaead8b15625",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:023a00d310521c01",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Shaft Torque",`quote`:"full_name=Shaft Torque; symbol=Tq; unit=Nm; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=other",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:69093b708616a9b8",`source`:"shipkg:fault:5bc176965c58",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:69093b708616a9b8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2937d3b0bfe9d29f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent engine caught fire. Fortunately the crew were able to quickly identify and isolate the source of the leak and extinguish the fire before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6915b2703a744d67",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:13f0f30403ca",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6915b2703a744d67",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9fa6115be15d0d77",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ntre main engine was started and all three main engines were put on standby in preparation for entering port. During this period, multiple alarms sounded in the ECR warning of low control air pressure. In response, two engineers searched the engine room for a possible air leak. The senior engineer in the ECR telephoned the bridge and informed the OOW that there was a problem with the compressed air supply and that there was a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:69786e65ac0d4312",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:851db4d72803",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:69786e65ac0d4312",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a642586c67899f4c",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Water Brake Weight",`quote`:"full_name=Water Brake Weight; symbol=F; unit=kgf; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=operating / load",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:69865d5640c42f6d",`source`:"shipkg:action:bb1cd030e27b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:69865d5640c42f6d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7ce8bf353caf8467",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"accident (Annex K). Carnival PLC has: • Included harmonic filters in its list of critical equipment for QM2, and has ensured that procedures exist for regular testing of their protection systems. • Developed and implemented procedures for dealing with harmonic filter imbalance alarms and entering harmonic filter rooms after an alarm has activated. • Replaced all the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter. Converteam has",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6c750ab1167f5f05",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:9d91c2845b73",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6c750ab1167f5f05",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a52dfb1b2f1d73b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"arrative A fully loaded ro-ro passenger ferry was en route to its next port when the engineers in the control room acknowledged a low oil pressure alarm on one of the generators (Figure 1). On the CCTV they observed that oil from this generator was spraying on to the adjacent generator. While they were investigating the source of the leak oil that had been sprayed on the exhaust casing of the adjacent en",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6d43abb57134c895",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:615199ab193b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6d43abb57134c895",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0cf3e7afa3cd10e1",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:LO Cooling Water Temp. Out",`quote`:"full_name=LO Cooling Water Temp. Out; symbol=T13; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6d8267a3c17fffe7",`source`:"shipkg:check:52bfc5553a79",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6d8267a3c17fffe7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6d8b95f5e6a9d440",`source`:"shipkg:component:3295e52dd075",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6d8b95f5e6a9d440",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dc67d8904baddd49",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"led, but fortunately the damage was above the waterline (Figure 1). The subsequent investigation identified that the vessel had a history of sluggish astern response. However, the crew had accepted this as a ‘characteristic’ of the vessel and usually compensated for it by demanding astern movements well in advance. The CPP control panel on the bridge had a back-up control button (Figure 2) fo",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6dc95451ac61158a",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4dcab8c954bb",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6dc95451ac61158a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7058770c39736963",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"24 the valves and their refitting was deemed an unnecessary measure. However, the oil sampling programme had not identified the wear in the back pressure valve as it had, most likely, occurred gradually over a long period of time. 2.3.3 Pipework joints and shielding Whereas the main components of Pride of Canterbury’s CPP system were supplied after testing by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6e310aa0e57264b3",`source`:"shipkg:check:f9cad3df2b98",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6e310aa0e57264b3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d8028bdc4d93a0c8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"Opportunities to identify and diagnose engine problems early, and therefore avoid catastrophic failures, were missed because the condition of the engine lubricating oil and coolant was not closely monitored. [2.6.2] [2.6.3] 9. Some aspects of the maintenance work carried out by RKM did not meet the standards set by Volvo Penta and those expected by Wightlink. Assembly errors had been made during overhauls, basic levels of workshop c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:6f3208cb56c01dc4",`source`:"shipkg:action:9e4b4715011c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:6f3208cb56c01dc4",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5350278460986ec7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row9",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3508B/C engine bearing reference; Fault or condition=Normal wear trend; Detection/event reference=Oil-led; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7160c42a9037688c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c9a34bd46532",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7160c42a9037688c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:755b4102fd859a55",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"y’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automat",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:71a5f51eb252d20d",`source`:"shipkg:action:f1e90ec0f59b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:71a5f51eb252d20d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6d6d03a1efd0d418",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"ated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation for abandoning the vessel, but instead took personal",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:71eeaf54c870a897",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:49d861a78ba3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:71eeaf54c870a897",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:01f3913bd9c46899",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"f Forth, Scotland on 25 January 2025 SUMMARY At 1305 on 25 January 2025, the site investigation vessel Kommandor Susan suffered a catastrophic failure of a diesel generator engine while conducting sea trials in the Firth of Forth, Scotland. The failure resulted in an engine room fire and a complete power blackout. The crew responded promptly, extinguished the fire and mustered safely. The vessel lost propu",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:724220f4d21e273c",`source`:"shipkg:fault:4e2929b80b35",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:724220f4d21e273c",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:ed4a18d326cb49be",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had introduced stress raisers that signficantly increased the likelihood of crack initiation and fatigue failure. Other factors that contributed to the engine failure included: standards of maintenance management; lack of appreciation of the importance of following the engine manufacturer’s instructions for the removal and refitting of the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:741858424c85adfc",`source`:"shipkg:observation:c07d705f633b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:741858424c85adfc",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9f5f82cce37a3aa9",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row10",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 engine case A EB / CAT C7 shaftline case A; Fault or condition=Fuel dilution; Detection/event reference=Oil-dominant alert at Month -0.3; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:74788259601dfac1",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:8b403808fd55",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:74788259601dfac1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:01f0c4c8cc7ce048",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh.Gas Temp. Turbine Out",`quote`:"full_name=Exh.Gas Temp. Turbine Out; symbol=T5; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:74bf120886032883",`source`:"shipkg:fault:f2f9d4b10a0b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:74bf120886032883",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4925b6b6f40f4c21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil sp",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:75ee4020dbf2ebef",`source`:"shipkg:fault:401ffd7724bc",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:75ee4020dbf2ebef",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0fb80ad604213aad",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure reading on the differential pressure gauge for the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:77b21a77dbefa723",`source`:"shipkg:component:1157de5d43da",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:77b21a77dbefa723",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e2523ed63e0b4019",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"at Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset o",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:77ba2ecdb044e119",`source`:"shipkg:cause:cf3cb78b47cf",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:77ba2ecdb044e119",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7407bf8cf7722325",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"am ensured the safety of the vessel, passengers and crew. • Volvo Penta’s investigation into the engine failure concluded that: ○ Debris in the engine’s oil channels was most probably responsible for initiating the failure. ○ When the shells of main bearing 5 turned, the lubrication supply to big end bearing 4 was blocked, resulting in destructive failure. • Rebuilding the engine in a clean and controlled environment and transferring it complete in",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:79b53f73ea93fe6f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:0e24c2957173",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:79b53f73ea93fe6f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f6bc70bef0a65cb3",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:AF_Clogging/AF_Clogging_75_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=AF_Clogging/AF_Clogging_75_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Air-filter clogging (compressor); nominal_load=75%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=5918; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7ba95c4cb6ec17c1",`source`:"shipkg:observation:59f88fb7c81e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7ba95c4cb6ec17c1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d61287b84a7d06e2",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row11",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 engine case A BB / CAT C7 shaftline case A; Fault or condition=Additive depletion; Detection/event reference=Oil-led alert at Month -1.0; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7bd0bbf2f100465b",`source`:"shipkg:component:26867a3d02f0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7bd0bbf2f100465b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:188654e8f7b787d6",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ked rag to fall onto the hot manifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the ca",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7c6f4f5491f19900",`source`:"shipkg:action:04317a406bca",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7c6f4f5491f19900",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:54970b12e1896794",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"70",`locator`:"PDF page 70",`quote`:"e of its capacitors and the circumstances that could lead to this. • Replaced the capacitors in QM2’s aft harmonic filter with an improved and safer design. • Carried out a quality audit of the capacitor manufacturer. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) has: • Progressed with existing work to review its rules to recognise and mitigate the hazard of arc-flash associated w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7d854c28045dd27b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c830e7992f26",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7d854c28045dd27b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5d3cde311b090a6a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automatically tripped the power to its motor to prevent it being damaged. Spirit of Discovery’s engineers could likely have quickly reset the port and starboard motors and restored the vessel’s propulsion had the propulsion motor overspeed trips been the only issue. However",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7e970cae72ca3bfa",`source`:"shipkg:fault:4cb7be531584",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7e970cae72ca3bfa",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4f930aa49cf38734",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ch went according to plan until the ferry was about 1½ ships’ length from its final berthing position, when her three main engine clutches disengaged almost simultaneously. No Air, No Clutch, No CPP , No Brakes Damage to lubrication oil pipe and bottom end bearing Bottom end bearing Failed lubricant oil pipe end fitting",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7f5cf32ac1fefe93",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:7b9d6be3e1e7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7f5cf32ac1fefe93",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fab039e22fe38b80",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. Out",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. Out; symbol=T17; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:7fc238db427a590a",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:ccfc2a47cee5",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:7fc238db427a590a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f6d35a82c4676820",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh.Gas Temp. Turbine In",`quote`:"full_name=Exh.Gas Temp. Turbine In; symbol=T4; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:824b41b5168825ff",`source`:"shipkg:check:f9cad3df2b98",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:824b41b5168825ff",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d8028bdc4d93a0c8",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"Opportunities to identify and diagnose engine problems early, and therefore avoid catastrophic failures, were missed because the condition of the engine lubricating oil and coolant was not closely monitored. [2.6.2] [2.6.3] 9. Some aspects of the maintenance work carried out by RKM did not meet the standards set by Volvo Penta and those expected by Wightlink. Assembly errors had been made during overhauls, basic levels of workshop c",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8313dd7847e227cb",`source`:"shipkg:condition:19ae439543bd",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8313dd7847e227cb",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9094aa614ec060db",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_14_Wight_Sky_engine_bearing_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b5217c7ed915d0b81e003df/MAIBInvReport14_2018.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ntrolled environment and transferring it complete into the engine room would have reduced the likelihood of debris ingress. • The engine was not fitted with a wear detector, so there was no means of receiving a warning before the engine failed. • The essential services switchboard aft circuit breaker had been left in manual mode, resulting in the loss of power to critical equipment, including the fixed fire-fighting system. ACTION TAKEN Wightli",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:83986fa88f6f4149",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7da9174934f9",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:83986fa88f6f4149",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:85dce6df90ffbd20",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"16",`locator`:"PDF page 16",`quote`:"turning gear control lever with the intention of disengaging the turning gear from the main engine flywheel. The turning gear was not marked in any way to show whether it was engaged or disengaged, and the operating instructions that were posted nearby had been painted over. The engineer then went to the machinery control room to start the engine. Although the indicator for the turning gear, which was sited on the control",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8450033baf33e125",`source`:"shipkg:fault:40958d8dddba",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8450033baf33e125",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9c5f7101c8442b54",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"essel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:868ce6db133ba4e8",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4ae93bca9f29",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:868ce6db133ba4e8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9d1bc8efb3c65396",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"27",`locator`:"PDF page 27",`quote`:"’s main engine fuel systems were historically reported in the vessel’s DOCMAP system. However, this had stopped over time and the crew instead repaired the leaks and recorded them locally in the engine room logbook. The relatively high turnover and heavy workload of engine room crew had resulted in defect reporting being considered a low priority, which had led to the requirements in SMS document SMM-0255 not bein",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8753f846c0d1bdaa",`source`:"shipkg:fault:b6b2c9f08149",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8753f846c0d1bdaa",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0f3029c8ff2b1f75",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"unications between the engine room department and the bridge are imprecise or vague. Such difficulties can usually be overcome by conducting realistic machinery drills. Although such drills are often difficult to programme, they are a very good investment which, if conducted properly, will probably save time and money in the long run. 3. Check cards can be a useful aid to fault diagnosis and re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:87a683549dfe4ae6",`source`:"shipkg:component:2a19cfd5c18a",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:87a683549dfe4ae6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:45cb3bc7993a557f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"y’s ME4 failed catastrophically because of an assembly error during build at Volvo Penta’s factory in Sweden. Two of the engine’s matched connecting rod big end bearing caps had been transposed during the engine assembly process. [2.3.2] 4. The transposition of the bearing caps reduced the metal-to-metal contact between surfaces of the connecting rods and their bearing caps. This would have caused fr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:87d565446043ac57",`source`:"shipkg:check:c55d526e8c4c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:87d565446043ac57",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8d208881ac72d263",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"69",`locator`:"PDF page 69",`quote`:"possibly leading to a blackout and loss of control in restricted waters, the need for power quality surveillance is significant. Regular monitoring of power quality, using a pre-determined pattern of propulsion motor loading with associated motor operating parameters, would help ensure that the health of electrical equipment on board is closely monitored as the vessel and its equipment ages",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:89e7f11ac7cd278b",`source`:"shipkg:condition:2d0261049d78",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:89e7f11ac7cd278b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2bd29efb1b18cf94",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shutting down. Lloyd’s Register (Europe, Middle East and Asia) (LR) has been recommended to take forward proposals to the International Association of Classification Societie",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8aebadd0b8fb956b",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:00688defba1b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8aebadd0b8fb956b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e9d71048b791d31a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil spray ignited when it came into contact with the hot exhaust casing. Figure 1: Location of the generator w",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8be6ccd9c21b5895",`source`:"shipkg:component:282dcd34a768",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8be6ccd9c21b5895",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8ce528e23e798dde",`source`:"shipkg:action:07654f6d6a9b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8ce528e23e798dde",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e5aaddc8a474eee",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emergency. They had never carried out an engine room flooding drill, and half of them had never carried out any form of emergency drill since joining the vessel. Are you prepared for a flooding emergency? 3. Examination of the isolating valve following the accident identified that the valve actua",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8dd7a98cdb768be6",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:5ed28aa334b7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8dd7a98cdb768be6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7116308e5054c090",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"CASE 5 20 MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 Narrative A fully loaded cargo ship departed port and proceeded on her voyage. Several days into the passage, the oil mist detector (OMD) on the medium speed diesel main engine alarmed. The duty engineer investigated but could not find any fault with the engine. He",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8e8b5c419663d869",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:e98fe7ad595f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8e8b5c419663d869",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f5da26689774f64c",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Loss with cooling water",`quote`:"full_name=Loss with cooling water; symbol=Qrej_eng; unit=kW; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=performance / derived",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8e8edc6938e19d0f",`source`:"shipkg:condition:ff44ed04fc9f",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8e8edc6938e19d0f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1143f5b1ae869724",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ation systems. Therefore, it is highly unlikely that the failure was the result of incorrect component assembly or a lack of oil. It is more likely that the failure was due to a weakness in the thin-walled shell bearing itself.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8e968f12aadfc671",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ebfac27b4d41",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8e968f12aadfc671",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a50b62c3875a33d5",`source_file`:"TSRF_main.zip",`source_url`:"https://github.com/TS-RF/TSRF",`page`:"",`locator`:"data/Ring-wear.csv",`quote`:"Ring-wear.csv",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8ea4d5eb1191201e",`source`:"shipkg:condition:32eb7154ffd7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8ea4d5eb1191201e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:09940c64e5709cec",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"n-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the repair to the oil pumps. They also showed that the pressure rea",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8edd104b50fabf49",`source`:"shipkg:fault:cdf116929c39",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8edd104b50fabf49",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:818a140783772a9b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"iple this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out,",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f56086f6d96387f",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:9785e5456d03",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f56086f6d96387f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:76e4e727d9b7b527",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Fuel Flow",`quote`:"full_name=Fuel Flow; symbol=Qfuel; unit=m3/h; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8f8daabafa8f297a",`source`:"shipkg:condition:37dbebf86df6",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8f8daabafa8f297a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:10c92776735ce916",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"35",`locator`:"PDF page 35",`quote`:"-10 bar. For all ships in its fleet: • Checked that all CPP system flanges meet standards recommended by manufacturers. • Checked all CPP system flanges are fitted with protective coverings. • Examined hi-fog systems to ensure that the system provides full coverage of all high-risk machinery. 4.2 WARTSILA Wartsila has issued a Technical Bulletin (Annex C) instructing operators to replace back pressure valves at leas",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:8fb7bd6c2a5c3fee",`source`:"shipkg:fault:256ba55c5fb2",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:8fb7bd6c2a5c3fee",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:2d2994aad520a17a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"MMENDATIONS 1. Stena Europe experienced a fire on one of its main engines due to an uncontrolled release of pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9376bd1a073fe759",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c830e7992f26",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9376bd1a073fe759",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5d3cde311b090a6a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automatically tripped the power to its motor to prevent it being damaged. Spirit of Discovery’s engineers could likely have quickly reset the port and starboard motors and restored the vessel’s propulsion had the propulsion motor overspeed trips been the only issue. However",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9392a5c0617470cf",`source`:"shipkg:cause:3667d8d2e0ca",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9392a5c0617470cf",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:93eb95c46bcd230e",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:e47b10fa62e0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:93eb95c46bcd230e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e79a186ddb29e3e0",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Compressor Filter Loss",`quote`:"full_name=Compressor Filter Loss; symbol=dPf; unit=Pa; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure; note=Present in all scenario files for schema uniformity; recorded values in 10 of 15 scenario files. Empty (not recorded) in: AC_Fouling_85_Load.csv, Clogged_Injector_Nozzle1_40_60_85_Load.csv, Clogged_Injector_Nozzle2_LoadProgram.csv, CW_Pump_Cavitation_60_Load.csv, CW_Pump_Cavitation_85_Load.csv.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:94a372da56ed7de3",`source`:"shipkg:cause:2152c85364f8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:94a372da56ed7de3",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4925b6b6f40f4c21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul during the recent dry dock (Figure 2b). This was hidden from view by the exhaust casing. • Fine oil sp",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:954e34ca7be3ab66",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c9a34bd46532",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:954e34ca7be3ab66",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:755b4102fd859a55",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"y’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s propulsion motor very rapidly increased and exceeded the preset overspeed limitation. The pod’s PCS therefore automat",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:95708c3b0b215737",`source`:"shipkg:action:b39684450af7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:95708c3b0b215737",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:808bd8d1dd9e51f9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. ● Increased the SISHIp eSiPODs overspeed activation point following a mechanical evaluation of the systems. ● Improved the position of the SISHIp eSiPODs bilge sensor arrangements. Meyer Werft GmbH has: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:958121aa9d470c6d",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:1320f5577cf0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:958121aa9d470c6d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:740294f08f945134",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Exh.Gas Vol. Flow (From Engine Speed)",`quote`:"full_name=Exh.Gas Vol. Flow (From Engine Speed); symbol=qexh; unit=NL/min; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=flow / fuel / air",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:95af5c1f611aa45d",`source`:"shipkg:condition:4a944c6dd633",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:95af5c1f611aa45d",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d82fabc2bbd1fcf1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e the aft HF from the electrical network. It was not possible to determine the exact cause of the subsequent blackout because the option for storing historical data concerning blackouts was not chosen at build. However, it is considered most likely that the disruption within the aft HF at the time of the accident caused general instability in the electrical network which could not be contained and led to the generators shuttin",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9765f6108f870d1a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2ac2de665aa1",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9765f6108f870d1a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8e948de9b710ce4f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"14",`locator`:"PDF page 14",`quote`:"ond compressor (No2) and reported his actions to the senior engineer in the ECR. Immediate investigation identified that the main lubricating oil discharge pipe assembly in No1 compressor had detached, and that the bottom end bearing had overheated and failed (see figure). No1 compressor was isolated but the engineers soon noticed that the air pressure in the main air receiver was dropping. Short",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:977acc2c1a469b20",`source`:"shipkg:fault:58d32c38d0ac",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:977acc2c1a469b20",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7d233ab71e7cf2a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"engine appeared to operate without any problems and the vessel undertook several voyages. However, after the engine failure, the duplex filter was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9a15d5f2a91bd86f",`source`:"shipkg:component:4d8f23e8a303",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9a15d5f2a91bd86f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3749ce726e3d4dcc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"26",`locator`:"PDF page 26",`quote`:"before it was able to spread. No one was hurt in the incident. Subsequent investigation revealed that: • The oil had come from a loose plug on the generator’s engine-mounted lubricating oil pump (Figure 2a). This had vibrated loose as a result of it being insufficiently tightened by shore staff during a recent dry dock. • A section of the adjacent generator’s exhaust piping had been left unlagged following its overhaul d",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9bbd133e0f7c66d7",`source`:"shipkg:check:52bfc5553a79",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9bbd133e0f7c66d7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:88dffcc589cf9235",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"y to bring the vessel back under control before it struck the quay. It was also revealed during the investigation that the system parameters for astern pitch control had been incorrectly set during the commissioning of the propulsion system when the vessel was delivered from the yard. The Lessons 1. If you are expected to manoeuvre a vessel, you should make every effort to familiarise yourself with the controls at yo",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9bd255a661fb3216",`source`:"shipkg:condition:94ebbaf1c3c4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9bd255a661fb3216",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:db9d3c4ba46b3f43",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9e3094523470666b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:e03af5ed68c1",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9e3094523470666b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:234ecd08fe047445",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:Pump_Cavitation/CW_Pump_Cavitation_85_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=Pump_Cavitation/CW_Pump_Cavitation_85_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Cooling-water pump cavitation; nominal_load=85%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=6263; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments. Compressor Filter Loss (dPf) and Turbine Back Pressure (dPex) not recorded in this run (columns present but empty).",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9e444dcb08b3cf88",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:1f391dbaad55",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9e444dcb08b3cf88",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:03eb6a301e78c0bb",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Fuel transfer pump Press.",`quote`:"full_name=Fuel transfer pump Press.; symbol=Pl_fuel; unit=V; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure; note=raw voltage signal associated with fuel-side pressure; not converted to engineering pressure units",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:9ffd2deb942f84c1",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:5d25f4bda048",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:9ffd2deb942f84c1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9c5f7101c8442b54",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"essel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a00df66932c3b4a0",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ce4fe75e21d8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a00df66932c3b4a0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f82c24711a999936",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"r was found without a filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a14d02dc6ef5351e",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:8c8343c45190",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a14d02dc6ef5351e",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:e1dce2948e24adc9",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"22 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 9 Sluggish Pitch Control Causes Serious Accident Narrative A chemical tanker was being manoeuvred to its designated jetty. As the vessel approached the quay, the pilot ordered an astern movement to enable a turn into the lock. The vessel did not respond and continued to proceed ahead. Despite placing the",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a19cc43e615431fd",`source`:"shipkg:fault:18191226708b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"