b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"articularly if they are tired or distracted. This type of risk is typically reduced on bridges and in engine control rooms by the fitting of protective covers over safety- critical buttons, switches and knobs. 2. The master was confident that he had control of his CPPs and did not look at the pitch indicators located on the control consoles. Had he done so he would have realised the st",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a47e8ddd52a5ad83",`source`:"shipkg:action:4f7d85454ee0",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a47e8ddd52a5ad83",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5e9ac17b88449c65",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"53",`locator`:"PDF page 53",`quote`:"s: ● Created an additional seakeeping and manoeuvring decision support poster and software tool for the Spirit Class vessels that includes propeller exposure in wave heights up to 10.5m.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a50fe553e63b2c68",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:47a6f6945bb5",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a50fe553e63b2c68",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5a827f088fee8abd",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"19",`locator`:"PDF page 19",`quote`:"er being dimmed overnight, the master attempted to adjust the brightness. Distracted by a conversation with the chief officer, he pressed the wrong button (Figure 1) and inadvertently switched the vessel’s starboard controllable pitch propeller (CPP) from its normal control mode to its back-up mode. The error was not spotted by the master or his bridge team as they continued toward",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a5ac50def4138319",`source`:"shipkg:action:2c60146dc1a8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a5ac50def4138319",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:74d39332305ecab7",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"and rectified the problem. Engineers are put on standby in control rooms during manoeuvring operations for a reason; not least to keep the bridge team informed of the status of all safety-critical systems. 4. The vessel’s crew were all experienced and many of them had spent most of their career operating similar types of vessels with the same company. However, the bridge and engineering teams did not",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a68f34b3f40e8af0",`source`:"shipkg:observation:83cf859e3d48",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a68f34b3f40e8af0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3ee08dc0eebc21a7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row8",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT C7 shaftline reductor / CAT C7 case B; Fault or condition=Babbitt wear (Pb); Detection/event reference=Vibration alert Month -4.0; oil alert at Month -1.2; Reference class=LTI_oil; LTI / warning (mo)=2.8; Warning (h)=420.0; Recommended CBM action=Oil-confirmed mixed follow-up; 250 h vibration / 250 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=yes",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a7849dbaa59c4e42",`source`:"shipkg:check:1c503f83ef89",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a7849dbaa59c4e42",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1a0b3fbe432ab46d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"8",`locator`:"PDF page 8",`quote`:"ting priorities during the vessel’s conversion project, this resulted in Hays Ships providing minimal oversight to Holderness and no verification of authenticity for the parts used, enabling the installation of non- OEM components that later contributed to the engine failure. Similar to the lack of oversight highlighted in both the Finlandia Seaways and Finnmaster cases, the lack of structured supervision a",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a921da9b784d08dd",`source`:"shipkg:cause:0c02674d6024",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a921da9b784d08dd",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5f282b514e870587",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"5",`locator`:"PDF page 5",`quote`:"oot cause is failure of connecting rod bearing number five. The excessive wear on the other connecting rod bearings show that the most likely root cause for the bearing failure is weak bonding of the copper layer. Evidence of weak material bonding was found in several bearings (Figure 4). Figure 3: Comparison between genuine OEM (left) and CTP bottom end bearings (right) Image courtesy of Pon Power",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a941c4a0c1aceb1f",`source`:"shipkg:fault:ccbff4c4e10b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a941c4a0c1aceb1f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c0ffd1edc9aa8938",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"afely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:a9e430b52edd4807",`source`:"shipkg:check:313a552b87bf",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:a9e430b52edd4807",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:33782f93bde6d8a1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"56",`locator`:"PDF page 56",`quote`:"d a competent fitter to undertake the specific task of removing the piston pin bushes at its workshops in Klaipeda. Despite this, seven of the intact 11 small ends removed from Finlandia Seaways’ engine were found to have notch damage on the internal surfaces of their small end eyes. Three of Botnia Seaways’ small ends had similar damage and three had evidence of localised heat damage. Although the technical investigations did not identify when the damage had",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ab74838432351b24",`source`:"shipkg:fault:91dfc7218234",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ab74838432351b24",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:79a139cd88957e11",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"dataset_index.csv:AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv",`quote`:"file_name=AC_Fouling/AC_Fouling_75_Load.csv; schema_type=scenario; scenario=Air-cooler fouling; nominal_load=75%; severity_or_program=single load condition; header_rows=3; data_rows=6354; columns=73; anomaly_state=binary (0=pre-anomaly, 1=anomaly); notes=Pre-anomaly and anomaly segments.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:abe3671795dbdb19",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:2ea813c04f69",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:abe3671795dbdb19",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a7fb6cfa2c672a77",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Air Temp. Out",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Air Temp. Out; symbol=T15; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ad0651ff8195736f",`source`:"shipkg:action:13d66975b925",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ad0651ff8195736f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9663fdde50e013ce",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"your disposal. The function of back-up controls should be well understood and tested. They can help prevent serious accidents. 2. Regular drills simulating propulsion system failure and recovery should be carried out. These drills will give operators confidence in the back-up systems and help them react effectively in an emergency. 3. Frequent engine response tests should be completed, both ahead and astern. This is part",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ae412ca4b7ccde0a",`source`:"shipkg:fault:dddb0abee018",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ae412ca4b7ccde0a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a33dab8e3476ce99",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"20",`locator`:"PDF page 20",`quote`:"tarboard CPP back-up control mode was inadvertently selected, the master lost bridge control of that propeller. The starboard CPP continued to thrust at over half ahead throughout the vessel’s approach to the berth and up until its engine was stopped (about 2 hours after the contact). Starboard pitch back-up on/off control button Centre console lamps dimmer control buttons Figure 1: Part of brid",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:afd37535d3e74b2b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:73da5c52ce5d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:afd37535d3e74b2b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:a0ea937863e1a2df",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"om and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour sprayed out, igniting and creating the likely conditions for an arc-flash",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b00fc5b7a5b9b248",`source`:"shipkg:action:d556abb4fcfa",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b00fc5b7a5b9b248",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dee08b2e20581c60",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"23",`locator`:"PDF page 23",`quote`:"wrong. 3. An oil mist detector gives advance warning of an impending major failure. When a detector alarm occurs, the thought of stopping and inspecting the engine as soon as possible should be uppermost in an engineer’s mind. The consequences of ignoring it are clear, and expensive.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b13b196a8c08dc9b",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:aea23b9943a4",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b13b196a8c08dc9b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:eb8d9ba0db21fede",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ent and Incident Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had intr",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b1eebdee30fa1762",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:5acc3a404383",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b1eebdee30fa1762",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:dec41aa5e554ca31",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Fuel Injector Cooling Oil Press.",`quote`:"full_name=Fuel Injector Cooling Oil Press.; symbol=Pl_valve; unit=V; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b42f8a837111b9db",`source`:"shipkg:symptom:ea2cdd59ea5c",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b42f8a837111b9db",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_