CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:b50ae7519f3ded28",`source`:"shipkg:fault:999defd690d8",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b50ae7519f3ded28",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0e28dc346f51844d",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"ifold and catch fire. The small fire then ignited the engine high temperature alarm cabling loom, causing it to short circuit and set off the alarm in the wheelhouse (Figure 2). The functional fire and smoke alarm sensors were some distance from the fire, and the smoke and heat had not migrated that far by the time the master noticed the smoke on the camera monitor.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b545dff5546fb648",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:870baabfbca3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b545dff5546fb648",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:766b43663daf2a75",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Fuel Temp.",`quote`:"full_name=Fuel Temp.; symbol=T18; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b61ac036fb40fd4f",`source`:"shipkg:component:67b7bcd7344e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b61ac036fb40fd4f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:df67722cb172233f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"21",`locator`:"PDF page 21",`quote`:"filter cartridge in the on-line filter chamber, and the engine lubricating oil system was contaminated. The contamination caused main bearing seizure, the rotation of bearing shells and the blockage of oil ways, and subsequent oil starvation and overheating to other bearings and to the pistons. The engine daily logs referred to oil filter cartridge changes only prior to the re",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:b69e7e03b8f16cff",`source`:"shipkg:action:a153887f0b20",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:b69e7e03b8f16cff",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:51f2102546185648",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row12",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3508B/C thruster reference; Fault or condition=Normal operation; Detection/event reference=Normal vibration and oil condition; N/A; Recommended CBM action=Standard monitoring; 500 h vibration / 500 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge