rsion`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bbd9dc87ea309aba",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:818a140783772a9b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"iple this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out,",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bc56748bb1f6339b",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2c644dcfc770",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bc56748bb1f6339b",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1143f5b1ae869724",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ation systems. Therefore, it is highly unlikely that the failure was the result of incorrect component assembly or a lack of oil. It is more likely that the failure was due to a weakness in the thin-walled shell bearing itself.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bcf16e46304a4dc7",`source`:"shipkg:condition:7fb8a1a33328",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bcf16e46304a4dc7",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:91f76498fecf4e21",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"43",`locator`:"PDF page 43",`quote`:"cating oil. In principle this was an entirely sensible precaution to protect the high voltage pod motor from damage. However, the low position of the bilge sensor meant that it could be activated by a relatively small amount of liquid that accumulated within the pod. Since the bilge suction probably did not extend low enough for the automatic bilge pumps to effectively pump the water out, it is likely the vessel’s motion in heavy weather caused the small amoun",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bd389e5f7d6e77d1",`source`:"shipkg:fault:511d6ce8c125",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bd389e5f7d6e77d1",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8bf90883ea90543a",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"gineer observed that water was almost level with the top of the main engine and was rising quickly. He started the bilge pump but could not reach the two sea water inlet valves as they were already more than a metre below the water level. The main engine then stopped and the engineer told the skipper that nothing could be done to stem the ingress of water. The Figure 1: Sequence showing fishing vessel s",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bd3c26a3f23de901",`source`:"shipkg:fault:2fa5f2876bb5",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bd3c26a3f23de901",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:5350278460986ec7",`source_file`:"Azimuth_Thruster_CBM_Dataset.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/20101612",`page`:"",`locator`:"table3_lti_by_fault_type_anonymised.csv:row9",`quote`:"System / engine-family case=CAT 3508B/C engine bearing reference; Fault or condition=Normal wear trend; Detection/event reference=Oil-led; ND (oil-led); Reference class=ND (oil-led); Recommended CBM action=Oil-led CBM; 500 h vibration / 125 h oil; Included in mechanical LTI summary=no",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:bdcf42a553da6f7f",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:65ae734da9ec",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:bdcf42a553da6f7f",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:400d60e3617603ce",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air Press.",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air Press.; symbol=Pturb; unit=kgf/cm2; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=pressure / derived pressure",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\"