e.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. The engine manufacturer’s recommended fuel system modification had been fitted to the external fuel system of just one of Stena Europe’s four main engines. The opportunity to fit",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f5554490157ed0c6",`source`:"shipkg:fault:323fee48e778",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f5554490157ed0c6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8b5ccc7bfc9235d4",`source_file`:"TSRF_main.zip",`source_url`:"https://github.com/TS-RF/TSRF",`page`:"",`locator`:"data/Ring-adhesion.csv",`quote`:"Ring-adhesion.csv",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f5679f933af5dd6a",`source`:"shipkg:component:e0a03cf176fe",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f5679f933af5dd6a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:861eb8fbe47cd585",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"29",`locator`:"PDF page 29",`quote`:"f pressurised fuel. The fuel sprayed onto the exposed exhaust manifold that was operating at a temperature exceeding 220°C when a screw in a two-screw flange within the fuel oil pipework loosened. [2.2] 2. The fuel oil spray was allowed to reach the hot surface because the joint was not protected by anti-splashing tape or shielding and fuel was able to escape forcefully. [2.3.2] 3. Th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f609ab43aaccb8c6",`source`:"shipkg:action:84a87c035a24",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f609ab43aaccb8c6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:d1a2571c248baad4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"41",`locator`:"PDF page 41",`quote`:"e was safely released from the suction side of the pump by using the bleed nut on the suction strainer. • Ensuring that the inlet flange was split in a controlled manner with a number of loosened bolts still in situ to enable them to be re-tightened in the event of the isolating valve not holding. 2. The crew’s response to the flooding was ineffective because they were not prepared for the emerge",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f80cec34ea31215a",`source`:"shipkg:sensor:7b9d6be3e1e7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f80cec34ea31215a",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fab039e22fe38b80",`source_file`:"Marine_Engine_Fault_Data_v1.zip",`source_url`:"https://zenodo.org/records/19857425",`page`:"",`locator`:"variable_dictionary.csv:Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. Out",`quote`:"full_name=Charge Air IC Cooling Water Temp. Out; symbol=T17; unit=°C; dtype=number; in_reference=TRUE; in_scenario_files=TRUE; category=temperature",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:f95f6bbe851a6ae8",`source`:"shipkg:condition:133adfa97595",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"cooling",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:f95f6bbe851a6ae8",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:6d6d03a1efd0d418",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"60",`locator`:"PDF page 60",`quote`:"ated as designed, with no one present in the wheelhouse to either see or hear it, it was not detected in time to save the vessel. Never leave the wheelhouse unmanned when underway; doing so is in contravention of the COLREGs and puts you and your vessel at risk. 2. The crew were instructed to enter the accommodation to collect lifejackets in preparation for abandoning the vessel, but instead took personal",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"cooling\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fad2b7fdbf57beee",`source`:"shipkg:condition:db2e89c50479",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fad2b7fdbf57beee",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:3bea0430b472030b",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"64",`locator`:"PDF page 64",`quote`:"current imbalance transformer were tested during manufacture, subsequent tests of the system were by secondary current injection, bypassing the windings. As the IAS did not specifically register which rank of the HF had developed an imbalance current, it was not possible to confirm if the current imbalance transformers on rank 1 1.3 had ever worked in service. It is concerning th",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:fdfcfa912161d0f0",`source`:"shipkg:equipment:61cd855f5970",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"transmission",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:fdfcfa912161d0f0",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:0b7a42308cc8b6cc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"D OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silica sand and other abrasive particles embe",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"transmission\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ff2bc2e691b752a6",`source`:"shipkg:fault:c8fa85d36573",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"electrical",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ff2bc2e691b752a6",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:f17ab4bbdcec2bfc",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e suppression spray heads were activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectri",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"electrical\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ff8cce45e75fb388",`source`:"shipkg:component:0dcadce61c82",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"fuel_air",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ff8cce45e75fb388",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:9c5f7101c8442b54",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"15",`locator`:"PDF page 15",`quote`:"essel was able to berth safely alongside, assisted by harbour tugs. Subsequent investigation identified that No2 compressor had a damaged discharge valve. Neither compressor had been able to keep up with demand.",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"fuel_air\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:ffd0b2d7d280b726",`source`:"shipkg:condition:6fa538170906",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`classification_rule`:"lubrication",`name`:"归属子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:ffd0b2d7d280b726",`case_id`:"",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:1b6ee0d38c733128",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_10_Kommandor_Susan_generator_bearing_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/catastrophic-engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-board-the-site-investigation-vessel-kommandor-susan",`page`:"6",`locator`:"PDF page 6",`quote`:"edules are only applicable for these parts. Non-Caterpillar parts used in the engine tent to have a shorter service life. [sic] • Check the use of non-Caterpillar bearings in the other engines on the vessel. If so, plan a early change of the main and connecting rod bearings. [sic] Parts approval process The approval process for a ship’s engine parts involved several steps to ensure compliance with safety and performanc",`props_json`:"{\"classification_rule\": \"lubrication\", \"name\": \"归属子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}}] AS row MATCH (a:ShipKG {id:row.source}), (b:ShipKG {id:row.target}) MERGE (a)-[r:BELONGS_TO_SUBSYSTEM {id:row.id}]->(b) SET r += row.properties RETURN count(r) AS processed_23 }
CALL () { UNWIND [{`id`:"edge:00bdaedd5815def3",`source`:"shipkg:case:adf367a46f33",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:00bdaedd5815def3",`case_id`:"wight_sky_me2_2018",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4846a9af2b7e6456",`source_file`:"MAIB_2022_04_Wight_Sky_multiple_engine_failures.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6267cc85e90e071690c1b679/2022-4-WightSky-Report.pdf",`page`:"84",`locator`:"PDF page 84",`quote`:"S 3.1 SAFETY ISSUES DIRECTLY CONTRIBUTING TO THE ACCIDENTS THAT HAVE BEEN ADDRESSED OR RESULTED IN RECOMMENDATIONS 1. Wight Sky’s ME2 failed catastrophically due to a sudden loss of lubricating oil supply to its number five main journal bearing and number four crankpin. [2.3.1] 2. The oilway to the main journal and crankpin was blocked off when the bearing shells turned in their housing. Poor fuel combustion, the presence of silic",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:0711483a996071c6",`source`:"shipkg:case:213f8edb92c2",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:0711483a996071c6",`case_id`:"queen_mary2_hf_2010",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:af6ff177f229c6a2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2011_28_Queen_Mary_2_harmonic_filter_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/547c6fa6ed915d4c10000031/QM2Report.pdf",`page`:"13",`locator`:"PDF page 13",`quote`:"e suppression spray heads were activated, one in the aft harmonic filter room and the other in the aft main switchboard room. The explosion was triggered by deterioration in the capacitors in the aft HF . Internal arcing between the capacitor plates developed, which vaporised the dielectric medium causing the internal pressure to increase, until it caused the capacitor casing to rupture. Dielectric fluid vapour spr",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:137bedc55f074afb",`source`:"shipkg:case:ad49b658b30b",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:137bedc55f074afb",`case_id`:"sd2016_14_sea_valve",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:b7715f5c139d9453",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"33 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 14 Fail to Plan, Plan to Fail Narrative On a fine day, a general cargo vessel was on passage with a cargo of limestone. The master was on watch on the bridge. In the engine room, the chief engineer, motorman and a seaman were undertaking maintenance on one of the two main ballast pumps; the chief engineer",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:14dc19c5ae0a6cd0",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:14dc19c5ae0a6cd0",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:57049bc52d7488e2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"mage to the port main engine room and rendered one of its four main engines inoperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ignited on part of the engine’s exhaust system that had",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:1bbb91e1fb7034b8",`source`:"shipkg:case:ffc594a9fab7",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:52e7560c8465",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:1bbb91e1fb7034b8",`case_id`:"sd2013_12_oily_rag",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:7293e870a8d5467f",`source_file`:"MAIB_2013_Safety_Digest_lubrication_bearing_cases.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/876748/2013-SD2-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"40",`locator`:"PDF page 40",`quote`:"CASE 12 39MAIB Safety Digest 2/2013 Narrative It was a clear, bright morning as the crew of a small passenger catamaran arrived on board to carry out their routine pre-sailing checks before their first trip of the day. While the master carried out his navigational aids checks, the mate went to the engine rooms and checked the fuel and main engines",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:25c0522a8c76df29",`source`:"shipkg:case:1f8ffc7c55c3",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:25c0522a8c76df29",`case_id`:"pride_can_cpp_2014",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:8c30394060f9cd2e",`source_file`:"MAIB_2015_22_Pride_of_Canterbury_CPP_hydraulic_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/563092daed915d566d000002/MAIBInvReport-22_2015.pdf",`page`:"30",`locator`:"PDF page 30",`quote`:"d, most likely, occurred gradually over a long period of time. 2.3.3 Pipework joints and shielding Whereas the main components of Pride of Canterbury’s CPP system were supplied after testing by the manufacturer, the interconnecting pipework was supplied and fitted by the shipyard when the vessel was constructed. Although the manufacturer’s drawings specified a particular type",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:27408755db4716c5",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:27408755db4716c5",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:fe1c60aff6da4452",`source_file`:"MAIB_2016_Safety_Digest_generator_oil_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e81e5d2d3bf7f13416961fa/2016-SD1-MAIBSafetyDigest.pdf",`page`:"59",`locator`:"PDF page 59",`quote`:"52 MAIB Safety Digest 1/2016 CASE 22 Supper Would Have Been on Time if the Vessel Had Not Sunk Narrative A 24m steel hulled fishing trawler, with a crew of six, was fishing in calm seas when its engine began to make unusual noises. No-one was in the wheelhouse; the skipper, who was on watch, had gone to the mess room to prepare supper and the majority of the crew wer",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3a7daa302187780c",`source`:"shipkg:case:d6e9f8f8ade2",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3a7daa302187780c",`case_id`:"finlandia_seaways_me_2018",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:eb8d9ba0db21fede",`source_file`:"MAIB_2021_02_Finlandia_Seaways_connecting_rod_failure.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/engine-failure-and-subsequent-fire-on-ro-ro-cargo-vessel-finlandia-seaways-with-1-person-injured",`page`:"9",`locator`:"PDF page 9",`quote`:"ent and Incident Investigation Division and the engine manufacturer, MAN Diesel and Turbo SE. The investigation identified that a fracture of the connecting rod small end had led to the sudden failure of the main engine. The investigation also found that the method used to replace the connecting rod small end piston pin bearing bushes by the vessel manager’s maintenance support contractor had intr",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:3d599eb3a886ff5a",`source`:"shipkg:case:63aa8b018e0d",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:5e357a568055",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:3d599eb3a886ff5a",`case_id`:"stena_europe_fuel_2023",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:57049bc52d7488e2",`source_file`:"MAIB_2024_20_Stena_Europe_fuel_spray_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6756db0ba63e1781efb87793/2024-20-StenaEurope.pdf",`page`:"7",`locator`:"PDF page 7",`quote`:"mage to the port main engine room and rendered one of its four main engines inoperative for several weeks. The fire was caused by fuel leaking under pressure from the fuel system of main engine number 3 and igniting on an exposed hot surface. No one was injured and there was no pollution. The investigation found that the fuel had ignited on part of the engine’s exhaust system that had",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:44e6ad50114682ee",`source`:"shipkg:case:9792cd36162e",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:d08eaf16cc46",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:44e6ad50114682ee",`case_id`:"windcat8_port_engine_2017",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:4e45851ecc9eb9f4",`source_file`:"MAIB_2018_01_Windcat8_bearing_failure_fire.pdf",`source_url`:"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/government/uploads/system/uploads/attachment_data/file/683922/MAIBInvReport01_2018.pdf",`page`:"1",`locator`:"PDF page 1",`quote`:"and no injuries. The MAIB investigation identified that the catastrophic damage to Windcat 8’s port main engine was caused by the failure of a piston connecting rod big end shell bearing, which resulted in the connecting rod assembly releasing and penetrating through the engine crankcase. The investigation also identified that: • A high oil temperature alarm prior to the engine failure warranted a more cautious a",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:47f51d2126c05caf",`source`:"shipkg:case:187dc871fbd5",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:4539c38d0a84",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:47f51d2126c05caf",`case_id`:"spirit_of_discovery_pods_2023",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）",`evidence_id`:"ev:c3429f0fc22579e1",`source_file`:"MAIB_2026_06_Spirit_of_Discovery_propulsion_loss.pdf",`source_url`:"https://www.gov.uk/maib-reports/loss-of-propulsion-in-heavy-weather-experienced-by-the-passenger-vessel-spirit-of-discovery-leading-to-over-100-injuries-and-one-fatality",`page`:"42",`locator`:"PDF page 42",`quote`:"e vessel’s heading. Given the weather conditions at the time, it is almost certain that Spirit of Discovery’s pitching caused the propellers to come out of the water. This caused a sudden reduction in torque on the propulsion motor and led to a very rapid increase in the motors’ rpm. The engine alarm and monitoring system recorded that, immediately before their shutdown, the rpm of each pod’s",`props_json`:"{\"name\": \"涉及子系统\", \"graph_version\": \"2.0\", \"is_causal\": false}"}},{`id`:"edge:4af0e99d2faed71b",`source`:"shipkg:case:6f58fb8a8b17",`target`:"shipkg:subsystem:512427f592b7",`properties`:{`name`:"涉及子系统",`graph_version`:"2.0",`is_causal`:false,`id`:"edge:4af0e99d2faed71b",`case_id`:"sd2016_22_cooling_pipe",`certainty`:"curated_classification",`certainty_zh`:"研究者分类（非因果结论）